    <p class="kicker">Contact</p>
    <h1>Let’s talk.</h1>
    <p class="intro">I’m HAO CHEN (Horace Chan). For project discussions, research-learning exchanges, or internship conversations, email is the most direct way to reach me.</p>

    <section class="channel">
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <a href="mailto:horacebuddle@gmail.com">horacebuddle@gmail.com</a>
      <p>Project, research-learning, and internship conversations.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="channel">
      <h2>GitHub</h2>
      <a href="https://github.com/HoraceCh">GitHub · HoraceCh</a>
      <p>Public code and project context.</p>
    </section>
    <p class="closing">A short introduction, your topic, and a relevant link are helpful.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
